*.pyc
.env
exports/

# Anonymisation golden source - real values, never committed
anonymisation/

# saved_views.json IS committed. It holds the curated view specifications -
# the questions, not their results - so the deployed app starts with the
# reviewed set rather than an empty list. Regenerate with seed_views.py.
# Note the trade-off: a redeploy restores this set over anything users saved
# on the server, which is the right default while the curated list is the
# deliverable.
